  "id": "intraindividual-differences",
  "term": "intraindividual differences",
  "definition": "Intraindividual differences are variations that occur within the same person over time, rather than differences between people. In this context, it refers to changes within an individual in attentional breadth and related brain responses across two measurement times.",
